# Shared SwiftFormat configuration.
#
# The Swift version lives here rather than in a .swift-version file: swiftly reads
# .swift-version as a toolchain selector and refuses to build when no toolchain of
# that exact version is installed, which breaks `swift build`/`swift test` in ios/.
#
# 5.7 rather than the newest: at 5.9 the redundantReturn rule rewrites switch
# statements into implicit-return switch expressions, which raises the minimum
# toolchain for anyone building the iOS package to Xcode 15.
--swiftversion 5.7
